{
  "name": "fy5253-last-tuesday-m06",
  "description": "pandas FY5253(weekday=1, startingMonth=6, variation='last'): the fiscal year ends on the Tuesday on or before and closest to the last day of month 6. Mapped to anchor edge end, month 6, day last, rule last, weeks start wednesday; years named by year_number 'end', which the generator checked numbers every FY5253 year of the 400-year cycle 1700-2099 consecutively. Year bounds 2000-2030, and the fiscal year located on each year's last day and the next year's first day for 2024-2026. The subdivision is an arbitrary valid 4-4-5 pattern that no case asserts.",
